course: dictionary
lesson: 2687
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and context tells you which meaning the writer wants. The word die is a good example. «The last known thylacine died in a zoo in 1936.» Here die means to stop living, because a zoo animal cannot be dead and still be a sighting.
explain: The same word can also name a thing. A die is a small cube with dots from 1 to 6, used in games. «Roll the die and count the dots» is about the cube, not about dying. Two of them are dice.
explain: Die is also used in phrases. «Rosa was dying to see the new film» means she wanted it very much. «The wind began to die down» means it became weaker. Ask yourself: does my chosen meaning make sense in this sentence?
fact: Die (verb) means to stop living. Its other forms are dies, died and dying.
fact: A die (noun) is one small cube with dots from 1 to 6. The plural is dice.
fact: To be dying to do something means you want it very much.
fact: To die down means to become weaker, like a fire or the wind.
fact: «The advice of RoSPA is never to go onto ice on ponds, lakes, rivers or canals.» Here die is the verb, because the warning is about dangerous ice.
exercise: «The last known thylacine died in a zoo in 1936.» In this sentence, what does died mean? | Rolled six on a game die | *Stopped living | Became weaker and quieter | Wanted it very much
exercise: «Roll the die and count the dots.» What is a die in this sentence? | *A small cube with dots from 1 to 6 | A long, quiet time | A sad part of a story | A kind of wind
exercise: Mia says, «I am dying to see the sea!» What does dying to mean here? | Becoming weaker | Stopping living | Feeling very ill | *Wanting it very much
test: The wind began to die down by evening. What does die down mean? | Rolled a six | Shouted loudly | *Became weaker | Stopped living
test: Which is the plural of die, the game cube? | *dice | die | dies | dices
exam: «Wait for trusted news before believing or sharing that a famous person has died; celebrity death hoaxes are common.» What does died mean here? | *Stopped living | A small cube with dots | Became weaker | Wanted it very much
